{"versions":[{"v":"0.13.1","t":"2026-10-12T09:12:11.876Z"},{"v":"0.13.0","t":"2026-10-09T16:17:49.291Z"},{"v":"0.12.0","t":"2026-10-09T15:56:09.706Z"},{"v":"0.11.0","t":"2026-10-09T07:23:17.491Z"},{"v":"0.10.7","t":"2026-10-09T05:33:56.859Z"},{"v":"0.10.6","t":"2026-10-08T17:44:43.454Z"},{"v":"0.10.5","t":"2026-10-08T17:26:37.680Z"},{"v":"0.10.4","t":"2026-10-08T16:48:09.288Z"},{"v":"0.10.3","t":"2026-10-08T15:46:34.397Z"},{"v":"0.10.2","t":"2026-10-08T15:14:21.432Z"},{"v":"0.10.1","t":"2026-10-08T14:52:04.535Z"},{"v":"0.10.0","t":"2026-10-08T14:32:58.509Z"}],"releases":[{"tag":"v0.13.1","name":null,"date":"2026-10-12T09:16:48Z","url":"https://github.com/vheins/opencode-asynchronous-agent/releases/tag/v0.13.1","prerelease":false,"body":"## Fixed\n\n- The `./server` entry now loads from a clean npm install: `@opencode-ai/plugin` is declared as a runtime dependency instead of a dev dependency (#1).\n- The core background hook is decoupled from the opt-in feature modules, so a missing optional dependency degrades only that feature instead of breaking plugin startup (#1).\n\n## Added\n\n- Packaging smoke test (`scripts/pack-smoke.mjs`) that installs the packed tarball into a clean directory and asserts the `./server` entry imports with its `tool.execute.before` hook registered (#1).\n\nFull details per CHANGELOG.\n"},{"tag":"v0.11.0","name":null,"date":"2026-10-09T07:24:06Z","url":"https://github.com/vheins/opencode-asynchronous-agent/releases/tag/v0.11.0","prerelease":false,"body":"**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/vheins/opencode-asynchronous-agent/compare/v0.10.7...v0.11.0"},{"tag":"v0.10.7","name":null,"date":"2026-10-09T05:29:56Z","url":"https://github.com/vheins/opencode-asynchronous-agent/releases/tag/v0.10.7","prerelease":false,"body":"**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/vheins/opencode-asynchronous-agent/compare/v0.10.6...v0.10.7"},{"tag":"v0.10.6","name":null,"date":"2026-10-08T17:41:26Z","url":"https://github.com/vheins/opencode-asynchronous-agent/rel